---
source: src/main.rs
expression: "render_help_snapshot(&[\"tunnel\", \"events\"])"
---
List lifecycle events, optionally following new ones

Usage: hooklistener tunnel events [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --cursor <CURSOR>          Resume after this cursor from an earlier events receipt
      --limit <N>                Maximum number of events per page [default: 50]
      --capture-id <CAPTURE_ID>  Only events for this capture
      --attempt-id <ATTEMPT_ID>  Only events for this delivery attempt
      --follow                   Keep polling for new events until interrupted
      --interval <DURATION>      Poll interval while following, such as 500ms, 2s, or 1m [default:
                                 1s]
  -o, --org <ORG_ID>             Organization ID (overrides the configured default)
  -h, --help                     Print help

Global options:
      --json               Output supported command responses or event streams as JSON
      --color <COLOR>      Styling policy for human output [default: auto] [possible values: auto,
                           always, never]
      --yes                Confirm destructive commands without an interactive prompt
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn,
                           error]
      --log-dir <DIR>      Directory for log files
      --log-stdout         Also write logs to stdout
